Review validation failure: $VALIDATION_FAILURE
The rejected response is preserved at $ANSWER. Correct its serialization/adjudication and return the full Review response using the unchanged checkpoint context above. This is Review-only recovery; do not rerun Implement, modify files, invent evidence, remove genuine missing requirements, weaken parent Completion, or claim success to satisfy validation. Required missing evidence must remain unresolved."
